# Convenience Directories
.archive/
.temp/
.delete/
.data/
.output/
# Also WITHOUT the trailing slash. `.output/` matches a directory only, so a SYMLINK
# named `.output` is not ignored — and `git add tests/` will then happily track it.
# That happened: two symlinks created for a verification run were committed, and the
# checkout replaced the real `.output` directories with self-referential broken links,
# destroying the preserved run artifacts inside them. Keep both forms.
.output

